{"id":"0f80b1d285566dbe","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-huge-cardinal.md","title":"Huge Cardinal","display":"thm-huge-cardinal — Huge Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-huge-cardinal","aliases":["58-thm-huge-cardinal","Huge Cardinal Theorem","Hugeness Properties"],"display":"thm-huge-cardinal — Huge Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-huge]]","[[58-df-supercompact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-huge-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-huge-cardinal</span><span>Huge Cardinal Theorem</span><span>Hugeness Properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-huge-cardinal — Huge Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"58-df-huge\">58-df-huge</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a78f267f6eefd08\" href=\"?note=6a78f267f6eefd08\" title=\"58-df-supercompact\">58-df-supercompact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Huge}\">\\(\\mathrm{Huge}\\)</span> (huge-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"58-df-huge\">58-df-huge</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\)</span> (supercompact-cardinal predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa) \\to \\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa) \\to \\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Consistency-strength hierarchy: huge cardinals are stronger than supercompact cardinals; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-huge notions strengthen hugeness as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> increases.</li>\n<li>Kunen's inconsistency: no elementary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j: V \\to V\">\\(j: V \\to V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A huge embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> has critical point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and target model closed under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\)</span>-sequences; iterated closure conditions define the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-huge hierarchy.</li>\n<li>There are also normal-measure characterizations at the level of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\kappa}\">\\([\\lambda]^{&lt;\\kappa}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Reinhardt cardinals (without AC) go even further.</li>\n<li>Applications include very strong reflection and compactness principles.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-huge","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-huge]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-supercompact","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-supercompact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-huge","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$ (huge-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-huge]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Huge}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa) \\to \\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"j: V \\to V","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"j(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"[\\lambda]^{<\\kappa}","display":false}],"bytes":1225,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-huge-cardinal.md|58-thm-huge-cardinal]]（batch16）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-inter